{"id":1769278,"retrievedAt":"2026-09-13T15:10:01.238Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/IneHx0wer3PMaLzyl072xMqSPq.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1769278,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_title":"FiNE NATURE SENSATiON at Zepp DiverCity","overview":"\"FiNE NATURE SENSATiON\" was a free concert given by the Japanese idol group BiSH at Zepp DiverCity (TOKYO) in Tokyo on 3 October 2022. For years BiSH had staged an annual free show called \"TOKYO BiSH SHiNE\" — nicknamed \"TBS\" — at Zepp Tokyo; for 2022 they renamed it \"FNS\" and moved it to Odaiba. Admission was open only to people holding a ticket for the 6 August date of TOKYO IDOL FESTIVAL 2022, the show BiSH had been forced to cancel at the last minute after Aina The End tested positive for COVID-19, and this concert was the make-good. Cent Chihiro Chittiii, Aina The End, Momoko Gumi Company, Hashiyasume Atsuko, Lingling and Ayuni D run through fifteen songs and four MC breaks in ninety minutes, among them \"Spark\", \"OTNK\", \"Shakai no Rule\", \"Promise the Star\" and \"Orchestra\". Streamed exclusively on niconico, it was released on 15 February 2023 as Blu-ray Disc 2 of the limited first edition of \"BiSH OUT of the BLUE\".","popularity":0.0643,"poster_path":"/2JdlKViLNM39TZXA79rzrNKrrfq.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"BiSH FiNE NATURE SENSATiON at Zepp DiverCity","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":2284032,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Cent Chihiro Chittiii","original_name":"セントチヒロ・チッチ","popularity":0.4484,"profile_path":"/6ElXLkaBILn8cp0Bbx75lWN0xLT.jpg","cast_id":1,"character":"Self","credit_id":"6aa5abe1a206b3ad91b2ae40","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id"